      <p source="#source-592-645"><seg source="#source-592-607">名護がよひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-607-625"><rb>薪</rb><rt>たきゞ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-625-637"><rb>積</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-637-645">む舟</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-645-692"><seg source="#source-645-657">午後六時</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-657-681"><rb>入江</rb><rt>いりえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-681-692">に来る</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-692-721"><seg source="#source-692-721">舟の中みだらなる歌</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-721-762"><seg source="#source-721-739">三味線のざれ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-739-751"><rb>弾</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-751-762">き聞ゆ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-762-798"><seg source="#source-762-798">おもしろき舟夫のなりはひ</seg></p>
    </body>
